      "source": "Class constructors accept a singleton <code>Endpoint</code> instance\nor an Endpoint specified by type <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>. When specified by type, the endpoint\nwill be instantiated and initialized through the Spring ApplicationContext before\neach client WebSocket connection.",
